fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"analytics/GstAnalyticsModelInfo.html#gst_analytics_modelinfo_get_group_id","fragment":"\n\tgst_analytics_modelinfo_get_group_id\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.ModelInfo.prototype.get_group_id\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.ModelInfo.get_group_id\n\nGet the group ID that groups related tensors together (e.g., all outputs\nfrom the same model).\nThe group ID is stored in the modelinfo section and is global for all\ntensors in the model.\nParameters:\nInstance of GstAnalyticsModelInfo\nThe group ID string, or NULL if not found.\nThe caller must free this with g_free when done.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nGet the group ID that groups related tensors together (e.g., all outputs\nfrom the same model).\nThe group ID is stored in the modelinfo section and is global for all\ntensors in the model.\nParameters:\nInstance of GstAnalytics.ModelInfo\nThe group ID string, or null if not found.\nThe caller must free this with GLib.prototype.free when done.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nGet the group ID that groups related tensors together (e.g., all outputs\nfrom the same model).\nThe group ID is stored in the modelinfo section and is global for all\ntensors in the model.\nParameters:\nInstance of GstAnalytics.ModelInfo\nThe group ID string, or None if not found.\nThe caller must free this with GLib.free when done.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});